# Richness: the words a brain is taught for finish, one shape each: a stroke character per brush, a fill texture per texture,
# a feathered edge, a gradient, and a painting the renderer makes itself. pnpm check plays it and looks for them on screen.

look paper
scene show figure lines=2 neutral steady
rect ink_brush 6,6 22x18 fill=accent brush=ink stroke=ink thick=2
rect dry_brush 32,6 22x18 fill=alt brush=dry stroke=ink thick=2
rect plain_brush 58,6 22x18 fill=dim stroke=ink thick=2
rect wash_tex 84,6 22x18 fill=accent tex=wash
rect hatch_tex 110,6 22x18 fill=alt tex=hatch
rect dots_tex 136,6 18x18 fill=accent tex=dots
rect grain_tex 6,30 22x18 fill=alt tex=grain
rect weave_tex 32,30 22x18 fill=accent tex=weave
circle soft_edge 76,40 9 fill=accent stroke=none soft=3
rect gradient_fill 94,30 22x18 fill=accent>alt
group land at=0,0
path hill in=land fill=accent stroke=none | M6,88 Q40,56 80,76 T154,70 L154,88 Z
circle sun in=land 128,62 6 fill=alt stroke=none
poly pine in=land 30,78 36,58 42,78 fill=ink stroke=none
paint art 6,54 148x34 over=land as=watercolor | a small landscape in washes
say title | Richness
say | A brush for each stroke, a texture for each fill, a soft edge and a gradient, and a painting made in the renderer.
wait 4
